mission "The Last Net"
    category "side"
    name "The Last Net"
    description "Take a bundle of netting twine to the fishing families at Blackwater Reach."
    source "Pelican's Rest"
    destination "Blackwater Reach"
    reward 280
    speaker offer "Old Jory Pike"
    speaker visit "Mina Pike"
    speaker complete "Mina Pike"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Old Jory Pike sits beside a heap of torn net, knotting the same length of twine over and over. His hands shake when he pulls it tight.`
            `"The shoal took our last good net in the blow. There's a bundle of proper twine waiting at Blackwater Reach, paid for by three families together. My boat won't make the crossing with this weather coming. Take it to my daughter Mina; she'll know what to do."`
            choice
                `"I'll bring it to her."`
                    accept
                `"I cannot take on another cargo."`
                    close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Last Net. Carry fishing twine from Pelican's Rest to Mina Pike at Blackwater Reach."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Mina Pike checks the twine and lets out a breath. "This will keep six boats working through the season. Father will pretend he was never worried, of course."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Mina gives you a small purse and a parcel of smoked fish for the voyage. "It is not much, but the whole village wanted you paid. Thank you for bringing us another season."`
